{
  "id": "throne",
  "name": "Ch.3 \u00b7 Let My People Go",
  "bg": "radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #180c14, #2e1830 65%, #0a0408)",
  "particle": "dusk",
  "svg": "placeholder",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "throne_0",
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "Moses. Moses.",
      "cite": "Exodus 3:4",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_1",
      "speaker": "moses",
      "fx": "type",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "left",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "Here I am.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_2",
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "Do not come any closer. Take off your sandals, for the place where you are standing is holy ground.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_3",
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "I have heard the cry of my people in Egypt. I have seen their suffering. I am come down to deliver them.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_4",
      "speaker": "moses",
      "fx": "type",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "left",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "Who am I, that I should go to Pharaoh and bring the Israelites out of Egypt?",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_5",
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "I will be with you. And this will be the sign to you that it is I who sent you: when you have brought the people out, you will worship God on this mountain.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_6",
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "Say to Pharaoh: \"Thus says the LORD: Let my people go, so that they may worship me.\"",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_7",
      "speaker": "moses",
      "fx": "type",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "left",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "What if they do not believe me? What if they say the LORD has not appeared to you?",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_8",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fx": "fade",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "God gave Moses three signs. A staff that became a serpent. A hand turned leprous and whole again. Water from the Nile turned to blood.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_9",
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "Aaron your brother will speak for you. You will be as God to him; he will be your prophet.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_10",
      "speaker": "moses",
      "fx": "fade",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "left",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "O Lord, please send someone else.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_11",
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "What is that in your hand?",
      "cite": "Exodus 4:2",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_12",
      "speaker": "moses",
      "fx": "fade",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "left",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "A staff.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "throne_13",
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "delay": 800,
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "placeholder",
      "text": "Throw it on the ground.",
      "width": "1/2",
      "valign": "middle"
    }
  ],
  "scene": "throne",
  "foreground": "fg_throne",
  "index": 2
}